  "body": "[HTMLElement constructors](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#html-element-constructors) step 6.2 says _Set element's custom element state to \"custom\"_ but it doesn't say to set the element's definition to _definition_. I think it should. Compare with the upgrade reaction.\n",
